      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW BRODY (6) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 22.81 beating Cindy Cabang. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Can measure up again. PAW OPPA (5) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at Horsham in a handy 23.47 beating Gaping Margin. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. PAW REX (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.10) in a Grade 5 at this track. Better than last start and can bounce back. PAW VERITY (7) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.3 lengths third (22.85) in a Grade 5 at this track.",
